repository-code: "https://github.com/XMECK-LAB/XRECONY"
url: "https://github.com/XMECK-LAB/XRECONY"
abstract: >-
  XRECONY is a Windows data-reconstruction workspace for readable data estates.
  It builds an evidence-backed structural twin in a separate workspace to support
  structural understanding, relationship analysis, duplicate/version candidate
  investigation, drift detection, evidence verification, and bounded copy-first
  realization without intentionally modifying the source.
keywords:
  - data reconstruction
  - structural metadata
  - filesystem analysis
  - evidence
  - drift detection
  - duplicate candidates
  - data estate
